  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 95e66c6366d904e98bc83428217d4fd7, type: 3}
  m_Name: Voyage - the sea moves her
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.VisualScripting.Flow::Unity.VisualScripting.ScriptGraphAsset
  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Voyage - the sea moves her","summary":"Wind and tide carry her besides her own way (Code/Game/Voyage/Adrift.cs, SeaPush.cs, RoughWaters.cs; Data/sea_push.json, rough_waters_793.json). When that does something she should know of, it comes here: the log says it, and the clock drops back where the moment calls for it. How much the sea moves her is the rule graphs'' (Game/Graphs/Rules: her leeway, blown downwind, a lee shore, the rough waters ...).","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"4de59afb-3258-43b1-b22b-70eff93fd4ba","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnTheSeaMovesHer","$id":"9"},{"defaultValues":{"words":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":460.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"df6443ea-69bf-4499-bee8-079d26fae03b","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LogSay","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":860.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"141476a4-8393-48b0-9575-1c6fd12e1207","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"13"},{"defaultValues":{"why":{"$content":"Pressing","$type":"Kapman.Game.ClockReason"}},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"665c6b9d-61a2-469f-8dc2-cc5cb843c797","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.ClockDropBack","$id":"15"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"5f74a56c-e47f-4762-b707-85a326b86f0e","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"c4af4ae2-b15b-446e-ae44-03b6fc5e0220","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"b8297c0e-1441-43b2-99b7-8809fac4e402","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"words","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"words","guid":"93876abf-e269-4368-9058-31756dac9457","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"drops","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"condition","guid":"4d31c7af-f4cd-4de7-a2a4-d41633d2c30c","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"why","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"why","guid":"8a1c43e3-1079-426a-b3cf-17123ce18964","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-90.0,"xMax":2060.0,"yMax":330.0},"label":"The sea moves her","comment":"Seven moments: she is set well off her line; she is held off a lee shore; lying to in deep water, she is carried; the steersman has lost his reckoning; she comes into rough water; along a coast he has laid her course again himself; a fog has cleared and she sails on.","color":{"r":0.62,"g":0.45,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"e330e729-faf2-4837-9321-20e4a0939ef5","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":540.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"The moments","body":"off_line: wind and tide have set her well off her line (the table''s offLineWarnM).\nlee_shore: she is set down on a shore she has not the way on to keep clear of.\nadrift: lying to in water too deep to anchor in, she goes where wind and tide carry her.\nlost: the steersman has run his distance and cannot make out his landfall; she lies to.\nrough: she comes into rough water (a race, a bar, a shoal, an open cape).\nrelaid: set well off her line along a coast, the steersman has laid her course again himself (your ruling of 10 October 2026).\ncleared: the air has cleared over a reckoning lost in it, and she sails on (the same day).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"0b6ba124-15c3-4a70-93b5-4930f459cd79","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":580.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":1140.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"The words, and the clock","body":"The words come with the event (\"Wind and tide have set her 9 km to the north-east of her line.\"): PLACEHOLDER WORDS, in Adrift.cs and RoughWaters.cs, the user''s to write. The clock drops back for all but ''adrift'' and ''relaid''; each reason has its own switch in the settings. To treat one moment otherwise, put a Switch on ''What'' after the event.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"6157ef87-0d20-40cc-816d-2e4595b0c5be","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1180.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":1740.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"What is not here","body":"What moves her and how much: the tide''s stream (a model of the real tides), her leeway, the wind''s drift, the steersman''s reckoning, keeping her off the land. Their numbers are rule graphs (Game/Graphs/Rules) and the table (Game/Data/sea_push.json); the rest is the code''s (Adrift.Carry, SeaPush).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"820acac3-534d-40ab-978a-79a20b42f1ac","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
    _objectReferences: []
